sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Source assistant
    participant C as Control plane
    participant D as Destination
    Note over S,D: An approved work-request grant links the projects
    S->>C: Publish selected<br/>work request
    Note over S,C: Store body in source<br/>project blob storage
    D->>C: exchange_inbox
    C-->>D: List granted exports and receipts
    D->>C: exchange_submit with export ID
    Note over C,D: Verify grant and body, create<br/>or find work, save receipt
    C-->>D: Work ID
    D->>C: work_run with<br/>exchange delivery key
    C-->>D: New or existing attempt
